Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.30,0:04:19.70,Title,,0,0,0,,《速度与激情6》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.57,0:01:36.07,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,西班牙 卡纳利群岛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.45,0:01:39.49,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,快点过来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.33,0:01:41.37,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,快过来 这边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.37,0:01:43.45,Title,NTP,0,0,15,,没事 我来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.45,0:01:45.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 你来的时间刚刚好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, it's okay, you're just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.14,0:01:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会是个好父亲的 布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to be a great father, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.88,0:01:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么这么确定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.26,0:01:52.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不好好表现 我就弄死你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'll be there to kick your ass if you ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.51,0:01:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.21,0:01:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.85,0:01:57.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.89,0:02:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住 你一旦踏入那扇门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, the second you go through those doors,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.90,0:02:04.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都改变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.40,0:02:07.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去的生活不复存在了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our old life is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.91,0:02:15.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去兜兜风吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go for a little ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.15,0:04:27.74,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,(莫斯科)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.94,0:04:47.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特别探员霍布斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Special Agent Hobbs?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:47.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱利·希克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riley Hicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.94,0:04:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看过你的简介 一流探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I read your file. Top of your class at FLETC.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.91,0:04:52.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去过开罗 突尼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cairo, Tunis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.41,0:04:54.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿富汗战争最年轻的地区安全警官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Youngest RSO ever in Afghanistan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你有你简历里的一半好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, if you're half as good as you are on paper,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.12,0:04:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们相处起来就没问题了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're going to get along just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:01.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俄国军方车队遭到袭击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Russian military caravan attacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.08,0:05:04.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卫星元件被盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}satellite component stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.34,0:05:05.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那车不知道从哪窜出来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cars just came out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六人入院 多车损毁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six hospitalized, a dozen vehicles destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:10.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一共只用了90秒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that in under 90 seconds, in and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.97,0:05:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对是一流的作案手法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is world-class.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.09,0:05:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一个团队能完成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Job this good, there's only one crew in the world who could get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.51,0:05:17.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这车怎么会跑那儿去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell did that get up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.98,0:05:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们抓住了一个罪犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They caught one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:24.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:27.76,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,(国际刑警总部)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:29.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帮你争取了五分钟的审问时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you five minutes with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.94,0:05:32.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两分钟就够{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only need two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.67,0:05:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要见你老板 肖在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want your boss. Where's Shaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.34,0:05:51.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我毛都不会告诉你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't telling you shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.01,0:05:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道你会这么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.81,0:06:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样合法吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that legal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:03.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.73,0:06:06.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你想进去劝架吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But are you going to go in there and tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.40,0:06:14.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有我的法律权利 你这混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got rights, you asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.86,0:06:16.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天你什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.54,0:06:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.05,0:06:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他开口了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, is he talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:35.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后什么也说不了啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.43,0:06:36.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那房间有监听器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That room is bugged, Hobbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.59,0:06:38.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你得到的消息 国际刑警组织都知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, any information you just beat out of him, Interpol has now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.06,0:06:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好极了 今天早上可以休息了 肖在伦敦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Now they can take the morning off. Shaw's in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.06,0:06:43.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们去抓他吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go pick him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.27,0:06:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小姐 欧文·肖可不是想抓就抓的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woman, you just don't pick up Owen Shaw like he's groceries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.02,0:06:48.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对付他要以暴制暴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to catch wolves, you need wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.57,0:06:50.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捕猎开始了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这一亿就花在这上面吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what 100 million buys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.13,0:07:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找你一点都不难 托雷托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't that hard to find you, Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.80,0:07:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又没在躲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退休的国际罪犯生活如何{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's the life of the retired international criminal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:05.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很喜欢这里 很平静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like it here. It's quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.98,0:08:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天气好得很{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice weather,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.52,0:08:09.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不用引渡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and no extradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警官 您有何贵干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what are you doing here, cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:15.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上周二 有支训练有素的车队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last Tuesday, a team of highly coordinated drivers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.03,0:08:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捣毁了一支俄国军方车队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}took down an entire military convoy in Russia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不在天冷的地方干活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't do cold weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.20,0:08:21.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道不是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:24.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你要帮我找出这支车队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're going to help me catch the team responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.29,0:08:27.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不需要这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you ain't gonna need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.17,0:08:30.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能抓他 霍布斯 他完全...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't touch him, Hobbs. You've got no powers...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:33.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想抓任何人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not here to extradite anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:35.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会主动帮我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, he's going to come voluntarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.21,0:08:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上 应该说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a matter of fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.34,0:08:39.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他得求我让他帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's going to beg me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.55,0:08:43.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一周前的照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was taken a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.06,0:08:47.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门口见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.37,0:09:10.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是莱蒂 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Letty, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.92,0:09:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果照片上是我老公{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that was my husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.59,0:09:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有机会 不管多渺小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if there was a chance, no matter how small,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.05,0:09:25.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都会奋力一搏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.07,0:09:46.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要知道一切 你手头一切信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to need everything, all the info you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.62,0:09:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带来队伍 就告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll get it when the team gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.41,0:09:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有队伍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.79,0:09:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就我一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is going to have to be me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.79,0:09:54.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想得太简单了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:55.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这支车队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crew we're after,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.87,0:09:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作案之后会马上消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they hit like thunder and disappear like smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.59,0:10:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想自己上吗 完全没有机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go in alone, you won't ever touch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.42,0:10:01.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我追这伙人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been chasing this
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.31,0:10:03.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追了四个大洲十二个国家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}guy across four continents and 12 countries,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.26,0:10:05.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以相信我 我最不想来的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and believe me, the last damn place I want to be right now
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是在你门口 忽悠你来帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is on your front doorstep, selling Girl Scout cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:11.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助 唐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your help, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:16.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你的队伍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.11,0:10:21.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们 把酒满上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, ladies, bring it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.49,0:10:23.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来祝个酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I want to make a toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.49,0:10:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.95,0:10:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你们有人已经去过澳门了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I know a few of y'all have already been to Macau,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.29,0:10:30.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但跟我一起去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you have never seen the town
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们才知道什么叫享受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}till you've seen it through my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.29,0:10:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有海景顶楼套房{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a penthouse suite
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.12,0:10:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会改变你们人生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with an ocean view that's going to change your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.00,0:10:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,150英尺游艇 艇上有直升机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}150-foot yacht with a helicopter pad...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该说 我将带你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm-hmm. Safe to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:42.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见识一下极乐世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're about to have the time of your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.63,0:10:44.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是你才对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.59,0:10:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.68,0:11:04.68,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,快看 开着法拉利的高富帅
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.76,0:11:08.48,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 你以前可是罗宾汉 有钱大家花
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.77,0:11:09.89,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,你懂我意思的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.89,0:11:11.81,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,钱改变了你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.81,0:11:13.03,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.03,0:11:14.73,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,钱的确改变了我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:18.48,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,我意识到钱不是树上长出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:21.78,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,是天上掉下来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:32.12,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 这里的东西好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.10,0:11:35.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,粤语不错嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.31,0:11:39.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这叫走遍世界都不怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a citizen of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:44.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想没想过安定下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever thought about settling down?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.53,0:11:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起开始一段新的人生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starting a life together?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.57,0:11:48.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在不就是这样吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't we doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.99,0:11:51.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:03.79,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,放下你的枪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:05.32,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:20.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪位 唐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Dom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.07,0:12:23.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.07,0:12:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥们 把飞机调个头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, my man, I need you to turn this plane around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.57,0:12:29.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们 计划有变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, listen, ladies. There's been a little change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.07,0:12:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有临时状况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.28,0:12:33.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前我跟你们说过的那家赌场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that casino I was telling you all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.74,0:12:35.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有他们那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got some vouchers
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.58,0:12:36.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自助餐的代金券{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the buffet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.43,0:12:50.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢这个吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.43,0:12:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他喜欢这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He likes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.16,0:12:53.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.31,0:12:55.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.43,0:12:56.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.39,0:12:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.60,0:13:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才是我儿子 我们来试飞一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my boy. All right, let's see how this thing flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在看吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.61,0:13:13.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看谁来了 这不是唐叔叔吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Uncle Dom. What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.24,0:13:15.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快招手 你好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you waving? What up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.12,0:13:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.91,0:13:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好吗司机叔叔 你好唐叔叔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up, Uncle Dom? What's up, Uncle Dom?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:22.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You excited to see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.29,0:13:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是已经塞车给人家了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you already pushing imports on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.13,0:13:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有 爸爸不会逼你做任何事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say, "Dad's not pushing anything."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.30,0:13:27.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他自己选的这辆车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He chose that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道他是奥康纳家的儿子 但是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know he's an O'Conner, but,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.97,0:13:31.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你带来了这个 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought you something, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.47,0:13:34.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了 他也是托雷托家的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! He's also a Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.97,0:13:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在还不着急做出选择呢 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luckily, he has a couple more years to decide, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.81,0:13:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家能决定了 米娅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he decided, Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他该睡午觉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's time for his nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.98,0:13:44.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, baby. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:48.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜拜啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:49.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这感觉很奇怪吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's weird, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.11,0:13:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.78,0:13:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在 有了一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.66,0:13:59.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至还有啤酒和烧烤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, down to the beer and the barbeque.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.62,0:14:01.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.96,0:14:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是感觉特别不像个家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, it just doesn't feel like home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.50,0:14:07.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是因为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's because, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.25,0:14:10.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些东西 直到失去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you don't realize how much you appreciate something
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.17,0:14:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才会珍惜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until somebody takes it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:14.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.14,0:14:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这地方变了许多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The place has probably changed so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:18.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也许认不出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you wouldn't even recognize it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.81,0:14:20.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.35,0:14:24.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.31,0:14:27.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么样 最近忙什么呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's up with you? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.99,0:14:37.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一周之前的照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taken a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:39.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外交安全局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diplomatic Security Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍布斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hobbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.34,0:14:50.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前也经常做这种事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I used to do this shit all the time as a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.01,0:14:54.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为警察就是这样 扰乱你的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is exactly what cops do. He's messing with your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.23,0:15:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱蒂死了 唐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letty's dead, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.27,0:15:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须要确定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.53,0:15:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和你一起去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:13.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说过 过去的都过去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you were going to leave this life behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.53,0:15:15.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都说过去的人生已经过去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We both said that we were leaving the life behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.99,0:15:17.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.95,0:15:19.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就像亲人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.78,0:15:22.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有难就要同当{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we got a problem, we deal with it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.91,0:15:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道你们在外面互相扶持{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll feel safer knowing you're both out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:27.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也会安心一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}watching each other's backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:31.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们联手会更强大 一直都是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're stronger together. You always were.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.51,0:15:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去找莱蒂吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now go get Letty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.99,0:15:37.58,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,(伦敦)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:38.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带她回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.32,0:15:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.99,0:16:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于有像样的装备了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally, some equipment I can work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.08,0:16:02.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吗 小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What up, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.16,0:16:03.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比在里约的那堆垃圾强多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is way better than that trash in Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:07.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强太多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Way better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.46,0:16:12.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对他们有把握吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure about these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.92,0:16:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.01,0:16:17.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有里欧或桑托斯的消息吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has anybody heard from Leo or Santos?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.13,0:16:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一次有人在蒙特卡洛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time anyone saw them,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去赌场的路上见过他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they were hitting up the casinos in Monte Carlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.97,0:16:23.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为那就是最后一单生意 布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought that was our last job, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.14,0:16:26.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些装备谁来买单 纳税人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And who's paying for all this equipment? The taxpayers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:29.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是我们现在为绿巨人卖命吗 是这样吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now we work for The Hulk? That's what we're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.23,0:16:32.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么闻到婴儿霜的味道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do I smell baby oil?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.98,0:16:34.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是再不闭上你的臭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you keep running your piehole,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.15,0:16:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会闻到屁股开花的味道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're going to smell an ass-kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.65,0:16:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍布斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Hobbs,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界上最优秀的队伍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you got the best crew in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.66,0:16:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}standing right in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.28,0:16:43.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他们一个留下的理由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give them a reason to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.87,0:16:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的目标是欧文·肖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our target is Owen Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.33,0:16:50.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前英国空军特勤队少校 黑色行动成员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Former major in the S.A.S., Spec-ops soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他曾掌控喀布尔和波斯尼亚的英国空中机动处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ran the UK's Mobility Division in Kabul and Basra.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:56.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真该死 这可不是盖的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, damn. That Mobility unit's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.51,0:17:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是战争载具 他们是世界一流的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're talking vehicular warfare. Best in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:01.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要点薯片吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got some chips?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.48,0:17:02.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们可不是等闲之辈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those guys don't mess around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.93,0:17:05.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多年来 他们一直在欧洲作案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For years, they've been running jobs in Europe,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.89,0:17:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近几桩生意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's their most recent jobs
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.18,0:17:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们名声大噪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that graduated them to a whole new level.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:12.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们袭击了三个特定目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three targets, highly specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.69,0:17:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个是洲际弹道导弹的编程终端{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The program terminal from an ICBM missile...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.36,0:17:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有零钱吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a little change?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.15,0:17:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously? You're a millionaire,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:20.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这样的百万富翁还问别人要钱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're still trying to ask for money?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.41,0:17:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是为什么你只是百万富翁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how you stay a millionaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what does this all mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.20,0:17:27.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最可能是肖的队伍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, our best guess is that Shaw's crew
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:29.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在建造某种暗影系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is building a Nightshade device.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一种科技炸弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A tech bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.83,0:17:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能使整个军方通讯电网{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Designed to block an entire military communication grid
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.38,0:17:35.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瘫痪24小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战斗中哪怕只有一秒分神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you blind a soldier for a single second
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.67,0:17:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也能因此丧命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the middle of a fight, he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.76,0:17:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整个国家的通讯被切断24小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you blind a country for 24 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.26,0:17:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所造成的伤亡根本无法想象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the loss of life is unthinkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.97,0:17:46.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在懂行的买家眼里这东西值几十亿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could be worth billions to the right buyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.81,0:17:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有几十亿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billions?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:50.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们干脆偷回来得了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we just steal that shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.73,0:17:51.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.81,0:17:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪个是一块钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which one of these things is a dollar?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.15,0:17:56.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里写着...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It says something about...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.03,0:18:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我请客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:08.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你们帮我捉到肖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to help me catch Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.66,0:18:11.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还缺最后一件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's only got one piece left that he needs,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.54,0:18:13.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要在他到手前阻止他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I intend to stop him before he gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你们像亲人一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I know you guys are a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:19.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我就给你们一个机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm offering you a chance right now
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.38,0:18:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让这个家庭再次团圆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to make that family whole again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.89,0:18:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想让我们再次团圆吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to make this family whole again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.23,0:18:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我们找莱蒂 我们会捉住肖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get us to Letty, we'll get you Shaw,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.69,0:18:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前的案底一笔勾销{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}full pardons all the way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:41.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个我保证不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't promise you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.78,0:18:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.45,0:18:50.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是条件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.20,0:18:52.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接不接受随你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it or leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.13,0:18:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们捉到肖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get me Shaw,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.21,0:19:02.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就给你们豁免{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'll get your pardons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:05.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都听到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.93,0:19:07.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这次不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是对付条子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not dealing with cops,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.93,0:19:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是对付毒贩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're not dealing with drug dealers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.81,0:19:13.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不是一个级别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a whole different level.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:18.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这活有报酬吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting paid, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把衣服掀起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lift your shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.49,0:19:32.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国际刑警在莫斯科逮到一个肖的手下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interpol picked up one of Shaw's guys in Moscow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.62,0:19:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对他进行了心理辅导{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went in, had a little therapy session with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.83,0:19:37.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他供出了肖的藏身之处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave up Shaw's hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.42,0:19:40.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们为什么不行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why aren't we down there now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.42,0:19:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家没邀请我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we weren't invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.80,0:19:47.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍布斯 诱饵已经放回去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hobbs, they're sending in your punching bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:48.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他带着通讯设备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's wired.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.79,0:19:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们行动之前先确定里面那个是不是肖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to give a positive ID on Shaw before they move in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.45,0:20:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,条子就这么把你放了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, the cops just let you go, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.28,0:20:12.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心 我什么都没说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, I didn't give them shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.41,0:20:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.87,0:20:17.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我启动它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}turn it over for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.05,0:20:29.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, it's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.30,0:20:34.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最简单的东西也能引发最大的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The simplest things can cause the biggest problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.52,0:20:38.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但好消息是 把坏的部分换掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good news is, if you swap out a bad part,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.77,0:20:43.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切还是完美无瑕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything runs smooth as silk again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:47.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 肖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.90,0:20:49.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, Shaw! Shaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.74,0:20:50.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.60,0:20:51.22,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,语音匹配 欧文·肖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.24,0:20:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认是肖无误 让他们行动吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just got confirmation on Shaw. They're going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.22,0:21:12.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 慢着 慢着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, hold up...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.56,0:21:14.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警用扫描设备显示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police scanners are saying
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.60,0:21:16.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国际刑警总部遭侵入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}alarms are going off at Interpol headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.52,0:21:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.93,0:21:19.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他引开我们 好去对付国际刑警{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He brought us here so he could take down Interpol.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.27,0:21:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切都是个陷阱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This whole thing's a set-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.56,0:21:23.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布莱恩 你带队走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brian, take the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.12,0:21:23.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.73,0:21:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍布斯和我等着肖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hobbs and I will wait for Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.03,0:21:27.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖能带我们找到莱蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaw leads to Letty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.95,0:21:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快出来 王八蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.00,0:21:44.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.42,0:21:47.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次干活的报酬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your share from the last job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.05,0:21:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是一份子 奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're part of the team, Oakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.80,0:21:53.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干了活当然有报酬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do your job, you get paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.06,0:21:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面还有点额外奖励{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a little extra in there for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.22,0:22:00.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就当是预支吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider it an advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.48,0:22:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预支什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.94,0:22:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预支下次任务的报酬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next job, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.77,0:22:06.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which job?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.19,0:22:09.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在做的这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one we're working right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.95,0:22:15.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,韩 离国际刑警总部还有多远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Han, how far are we from Interpol?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.83,0:22:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有两个街口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twelve blocks away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.16,0:22:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计们 这里跟座鬼城一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys, it's a ghost town over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.75,0:22:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖把所有条子都引到那边去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaw must have pulled all the cops to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.41,0:22:23.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏该结束了 干掉他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, y'all, we're in this shit, so let's go get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.00,0:22:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你赛车很愉快 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been fun running with you, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.34,0:22:35.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把包扔掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Drop the bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.89,0:23:20.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.69,0:23:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.69,0:23:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托雷托 在你前面 别跟丢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toretto, it's on you. Straight ahead, don't lose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.77,0:23:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.29,0:24:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about that, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.98,0:24:48.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国际刑警总部就在前面了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interpol, straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.32,0:24:55.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄弟们 有贵客上门了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, guys. We've got company.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.34,0:25:14.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行动 兄弟们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.21,0:25:17.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.06,0:25:30.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得行动 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! We got to move. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.86,0:25:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖 有三辆车尾随我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaw, we have three cars tailing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.63,0:25:40.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.02,0:25:49.19,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好芯片干扰 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.54,0:25:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来应付这辆路虎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, I got the Rover.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.38,0:25:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 那我来应付...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I got...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.59,0:25:59.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个叫不上名的鬼东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever the hell that thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.40,0:26:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么 冰球吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that, a hockey puck?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.97,0:26:19.89,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,打中了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.81,0:26:30.06,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,一号芯片已就绪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.88,0:26:47.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.89,0:27:02.43,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一台芯片就位
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.27,0:27:13.23,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,没用 没用
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.79,0:27:17.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在接近目标位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Approaching rendezvous point.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.47,0:27:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唐 泰吉和罗曼被撞翻了 你在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom! Tej and Roman are out! Where you at?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.55,0:27:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就在你后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm right behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.57,0:27:47.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快到了 我要放手一搏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay on track. I'm taking the contingency.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.66,0:27:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙 我盯住肖了 他刚刚左转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boys, I got eyes on Shaw. He just made a left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.58,0:27:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去右边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.55,0:27:55.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托雷托 左转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toretto, make that left!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.74,0:28:04.28,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,玮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.57,0:28:05.45,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.80,0:28:06.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.25,0:29:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.60,0:29:37.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来驾驶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.76,0:30:12.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.15,0:30:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.49,0:30:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们又不是在巴西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not in Brazil.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.82,0:30:35.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们居然玩起了空中飞车?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, now we got cars flying in the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.16,0:30:39.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是在拍007吗 我们不能这样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On some 007-type shit? This is not what we do!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.50,0:30:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计 你该去做心理检查了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, you really got to check that emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.92,0:30:44.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的公鸭嗓都变成狗狗音了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your voice just went from Shaggy to Scooby-Doo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.83,0:30:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"我们不能...汪汪汪"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"This is not what we..."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.84,0:30:49.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当一个女人冲你开枪时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, man, when a woman starts shooting at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.09,0:30:52.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就该夹起尾巴开溜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's a clear sign to back the fuck off!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.09,0:30:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能再这样下去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get the hell out of Dodge!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.47,0:31:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果打中我脑门怎么办 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That could have been my forehead, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.52,0:31:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.69,0:31:03.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你脑门比这大多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not as big as your forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.69,0:31:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米娅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.86,0:31:15.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是莱蒂没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, It's definitely Letty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.82,0:31:17.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但情况很复杂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's, uh.. It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.03,0:31:19.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱蒂还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letty's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.04,0:31:21.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才是最重要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.54,0:31:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都支持她 布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have her back, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.88,0:31:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我给杰克一个晚安吻吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, do me a favor and give Jack a kiss goodnight for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.51,0:31:32.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要平安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.61,0:31:33.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你 米娅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.69,0:31:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她看清楚是你了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She definitely saw it was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.57,0:31:52.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她直盯着我 布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She looked dead at me, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.99,0:31:56.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我们认识的莱蒂已经消失了 唐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe the Letty we once knew is gone, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.24,0:32:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算她还活着 也不是原来的她了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even though she's alive, maybe she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.08,0:32:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能跟亲人反目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't turn your back on family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.25,0:32:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使他们这样做了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even when they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.65,0:32:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾维{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ivory.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.80,0:32:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.44,0:32:32.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这辆车需要修理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going to need some repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.11,0:32:34.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题 甜心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem, treacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.61,0:32:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.61,0:32:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.53,0:32:42.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 全体注意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.70,0:32:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次跟霍布斯以往那些喽啰不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a very different breed from Hobbs' usual wannabe warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.29,0:32:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来看看他们是什么来头 都有什么本事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to learn who these people are, what they're made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.04,0:32:52.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vegh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.76,0:32:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥康纳 帕克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Conner, Parker,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.55,0:33:01.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮尔斯 托雷托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pearce, Toretto
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.39,0:33:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加上其他队员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the rest of the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.27,0:33:06.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这群人都是普通罪犯而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys are common criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.31,0:33:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这群普通罪犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight these common criminals were seconds away
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.40,0:33:09.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差点将我们打败{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from taking us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.94,0:33:13.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他们应有的尊重 不然骄兵必败{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show them the respect they deserve, or it weakens us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.73,0:33:15.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该看看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might want to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.16,0:33:23.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能想起什么来吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ring any bells?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.84,0:33:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.09,0:33:36.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我打伤的那个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the guy I shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.67,0:33:37.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照片里你挺开心的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.97,0:33:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不记得他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.43,0:33:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直胡说八道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.26,0:33:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有麻烦了 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a problem, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.60,0:33:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟她合影的那个男人差点就把你拉下马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a picture of her with the guy who almost took you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.60,0:33:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克劳斯 你不是肌肉男吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Klaus, aren't you team muscle?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.35,0:33:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别逼我不讲情面 把你变成娘炮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make me go over there and make you team pussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.52,0:33:55.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不记得他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She doesn't remember him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.19,0:33:58.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光有名字和档案还不够{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Names and records aren't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.36,0:34:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要私人信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want personal information.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.16,0:34:02.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生活琐事 他们的所思所想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get into their lives, into their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.82,0:34:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦找到弱点 就能将他们一举击溃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find their weaknesses, and we will exploit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.88,0:34:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm-hmm. Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.63,0:34:16.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也太疯狂了 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is crazy, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.38,0:34:17.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又在嘟囔什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.01,0:34:20.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这里查看这些图片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sitting here looking at these images,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.97,0:34:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好象要追捕邪恶版本的自己一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's like we're hunting our evil twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.72,0:34:26.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看这个小黑哥 他真帅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this black dude right here, he's handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.51,0:34:27.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直是我的影子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clearly, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.56,0:34:31.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有白版霍布斯 这是韩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a white Hobbs. This is Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.35,0:34:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是泰吉 还带着非洲小帽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tej, it's an African in a beanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.57,0:34:37.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像你的迷你版本{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's like your Mini-Me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.07,0:34:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Brian!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.45,0:34:43.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么时候拍的这写真{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did you do this photo shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.12,0:34:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我逗逗你而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just playing, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.58,0:34:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是这里最美的金发妞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you're the prettiest blonde around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.96,0:34:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都给我精神点 两件事要说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, lock it up. We got two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.25,0:34:58.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First off,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.71,0:35:01.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这城市是罪犯的噩梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is the worst damn city in the world to commit a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.38,0:35:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个街角都有监控摄像头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got cameras on every street corner.
