Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.60,0:35:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看我们能不能发现什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's track that, see where it leads us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.18,0:35:07.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And secondly,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.70,0:35:10.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道了肖的团伙抢了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we just got confirmation on what Shaw's crew grabbed from Interpol.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.52,0:35:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们黑了一个数据库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They ripped off the database
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.77,0:35:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面有他们要的东西存放的地点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of every location that houses the final component that they need.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.73,0:35:15.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So where are they at?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.86,0:35:17.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在欧洲一共有20多个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are over two dozen of them around Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.77,0:35:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这列表有效期只有96小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the list is only good for 96 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.07,0:35:22.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这意味着 不管他们目标是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means, wherever Shaw's crew is going to hit next,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.20,0:35:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们一定在四天内动手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's going to happen within the next four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.20,0:35:25.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们有目标了 我们也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got a window, and so do we.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.49,0:35:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动手吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta move.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.29,0:35:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍布斯说的对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hobbs is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.49,0:35:28.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来分析一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let's break this down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.95,0:35:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大干一场吧 我们有什么情报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You met them. What do we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.08,0:35:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们一定在用自己订制的引擎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know they have to be running custom engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.46,0:35:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也听到那车换档的声音了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard that flip car going through those gears.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.25,0:35:35.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺序式变速箱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sequential transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.54,0:35:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那引擎听起来可不一般{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That didn't sound like a normal engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.13,0:35:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柴油涡轮增压引擎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a turbo diesel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.80,0:35:40.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它听起来是从勒芒来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It sounded like something you hear at Le Mans.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.30,0:35:41.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算被撞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see it take all those hits
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.42,0:35:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那车也能保持平稳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and still stay flat in the corners?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.63,0:35:43.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 液压稳定装置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, hydraulics.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.93,0:35:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有磁悬浮悬挂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or magnetic suspension.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.30,0:35:47.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想想有谁能接触到那些零件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who not only has access to the components,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.47,0:35:48.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能改造它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but can fabricate something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.97,0:35:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伦敦有很多店可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe a handful of shops in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.81,0:35:53.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普通的店可不敢做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Regular tuner shops aren't going to cut it on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.69,0:35:55.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得深挖一下线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to have to dig deeper than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.27,0:35:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,韩 吉赛尔和罗曼 你们上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Han, Gisele, Roman, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.15,0:36:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只要找到造那辆车的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We find the guy who made that car,
