Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.00,0:36:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.78,0:36:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰吉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tej,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.04,0:36:11.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要不带芯片的车子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're gonna need cars without computer chips that can be overridden.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.41,0:36:13.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须快到极致{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure they're fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.96,0:36:16.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.08,0:36:17.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经在办了 唐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm already on it, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.33,0:36:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我联系了皇家海军和外交安全局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've contacted R&D at DSS.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.96,0:36:20.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍布斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hobbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.59,0:36:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了就看我的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.34,0:36:26.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越来越有趣了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This should be interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.02,0:36:41.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计 你得放轻松点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, you really got to loosen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.86,0:36:42.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就弄些工厂出的普通货色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't just throw a bunch
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.89,0:36:44.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些行家可不会满意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of factory-line Beemers at people and expect...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.78,0:36:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是一辆牛车啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. That car is a hell of a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.53,0:36:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,双涡轮增压V8引擎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're talking about twin-turbo V8,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.37,0:36:50.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,足有560匹马力呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}spitting out 560 ponies, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.41,0:36:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做了不少功课啊 真替你感到骄傲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He reads the brochure. I'm proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.20,0:36:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只有订制的车子才最牛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But with cars, you have to customize.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.54,0:36:57.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你和车之间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all between you and the car you build.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.46,0:36:59.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须有一种联系 一种承诺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bond, it's a commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.29,0:37:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来和结婚没两样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It sounds like a marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.00,0:37:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你和车子分手时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but with cars, when you trade up,
