Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.05,0:37:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天爷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.13,0:37:10.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看这价位 车子肯定是黄金打造{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With price tags like this, these cars better be made out of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.02,0:37:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会在考虑偷这些车吧 帕克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't thinking about stealing these cars, are you, Parker?
