Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.77,0:37:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.90,0:37:23.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无意冒犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't mean any offense, gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.27,0:37:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你们可买不起这些车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you couldn't possibly afford the cars in this auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.24,0:37:30.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全身没带点珠宝 也没点贵族气息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Substantial lack of gaudy jewelry, no entourage, no honeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.57,0:37:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明显 你也不是个舞伴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clearly you're not a "Baller."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.91,0:37:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.08,0:37:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是鞋子衬衣还是裤子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm. Shoes, shirt, trousers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.58,0:37:38.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是休闲的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Functional.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.71,0:37:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身姿又很僵硬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your posture, too rigid, no swagger.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.88,0:37:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,估计是个5万块钱一年的大兵哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My guess is military. Take home of 50,000 a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.80,0:37:45.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说的可是美元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.26,0:37:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定不够你来这儿花销了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is not enough to be playing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.72,0:37:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要不是帮厨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, if you're not kitchen help,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.43,0:37:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那肯定是来错地方了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you must be in the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.59,0:37:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过呢 喝完这杯再走人吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But please, do finish your champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.02,0:38:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得给他点教训才行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he needs to be taught a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.27,0:38:03.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过了 你不可以偷这些车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I said, you ain't stealing these cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.07,0:38:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.20,0:38:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了 这就是列表上的5号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, this is number five on our list.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.29,0:38:19.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的老天爷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.62,0:38:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那伙计要猎杀什么啊 大白鲸吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the dude plan on hunting? Moby Dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.79,0:38:24.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他没错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That must be our guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.59,0:38:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们准备怎么下手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, how do you all want to play this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.21,0:38:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和韩就能搞定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Han and I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.01,0:38:32.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们俩下去 让我来搞定一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go in tight, you let me do all the talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.59,0:38:33.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们站后面看就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you all have my back on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.10,0:38:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你俩老爷们忘了一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's one thing you boys are forgetting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.14,0:38:39.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他终归是个男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.48,0:38:40.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.60,0:38:43.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"He's a man?"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.23,0:38:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她总是这么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, she always says that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.82,0:38:55.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你手里的是5.45乘18口径{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you're looking at is a 5.45...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.58,0:38:57.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,FMJ全金属弹头子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by 18 FMJ spitzer bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.99,0:39:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是手枪专用子弹 PSM手枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's specific to one handgun, the PSM.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.08,0:39:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上 私持手枪在英国是违法的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Given that handguns are illegal in the United Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.08,0:39:06.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有少数人可以持有那样的枪械{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's very few people that have access to that firearm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.84,0:39:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if somebody wanted to, say,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.46,0:39:10.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追查枪的来源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}track down where it came from,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.67,0:39:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会太困难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it wouldn't be too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.84,0:39:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当警察那么久 老习惯还是改不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a cop for a lot of years. Some habits die hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.30,0:39:18.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,典当铺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pawn shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.15,0:39:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁介绍你们来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who sent you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.41,0:39:32.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说吧 美人儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.78,0:39:36.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一般像你俩这种美人儿来我这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two hot girls like you don't wander into this neighborhood
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.45,0:39:38.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都会先打个电话给你们妈咪的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless l've called the escort service.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.79,0:39:41.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天不打电话竟然自动上门了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And l haven't, yet, today.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.76,0:39:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们行吗 我可不看好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, man. That was disrespectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.85,0:39:47.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不喜欢她的语气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't like the way she said it,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.48,0:39:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他终归是个男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like, "He's a man."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.89,0:39:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个男人 那我们算什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"He's a man?" So, what are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.65,0:39:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 她只是为了任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, she's just doing her job.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.90,0:39:58.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么为了任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Doing her job."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.11,0:40:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我算看明白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.70,0:40:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看明白什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.12,0:40:06.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你八成爱上她了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got the little stardust in your eyes, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.62,0:40:08.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱情鸟在脑袋周围转圈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little birds floating around a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.29,0:40:15.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,合伙做任务不够 你还想纳她入后宫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, you don't want to lease this model. You want to buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.88,0:40:17.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以闭嘴了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you please stop talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.21,0:40:21.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你坠入爱河啦 看看你的样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, you're in love! Look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.26,0:40:22.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快闭嘴吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.97,0:40:25.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有制定泡妞计划 来个美妙约会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got special plans? Big day?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.39,0:40:26.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我们都请来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to invite us all out?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.06,0:40:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可得买颗大点的钻石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better make sure you get her a big rock, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.89,0:40:30.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她可没那么容易被驯服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause she doesn't look like she'll be that easily impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.48,0:40:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是钻石不大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if it's not a big rock,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.27,0:40:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那玩意儿大也行呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you better be big somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.48,0:40:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你懂的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.44,0:40:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你马子才带那么多首饰是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why all your girlfriends wear so much bling, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.82,0:40:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要点情报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're looking for information.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.24,0:40:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们需要情报? 有关什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking for information? About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.37,0:40:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是有关车子的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Information about cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.25,0:40:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是你最近设计的两辆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In particular, two you designed recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.67,0:40:55.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,道奇公羊 低底盘 车颈框架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ramp cars. Low slung, skeletal frames.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.79,0:40:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们对买那些车的人很感兴趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd be very interested to find the man who bought those.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.13,0:41:00.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为什么要帮你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.26,0:41:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们真诚相求了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we're asking you nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.67,0:41:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就因为真诚相求吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you're asking me nicely?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.22,0:41:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就看你有什么特殊的本事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can you offer that I can't get from a thousand other girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.23,0:41:12.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手 住手啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.03,0:41:22.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看上去挺能抗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like a man who likes it rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.11,0:41:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的这位朋友可以给你最剧烈的疼痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend here can give you heights of pain
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.24,0:41:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我敢肯定你以前从未体验过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've never experienced before.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.96,0:41:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想做交易了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we have a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.04,0:41:36.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做 我做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deal! Deal! Deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.83,0:41:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我收回刚才的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.38,0:41:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也爱这小妞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me likey.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.98,0:41:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 好了 停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop, stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.19,0:41:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你的方法吗 把它们全买下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is how you  "got this"? By buying all of his cars?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.90,0:42:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钱都烂在银行的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What good is having millions of dollars in the bank
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.07,0:42:02.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人生就没有意义了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you don't spend any of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.65,0:42:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心 看我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't worry about that. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.41,0:42:08.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕克先生 请允许我再一次表达谢意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Parker, again, can I just express our gratitude
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.70,0:42:11.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感谢您带来的生意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and say how much we appreciate your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.20,0:42:13.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果您还有任何需要 请尽管提出要求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's ever anything else you need, you just have to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.91,0:42:14.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何需要吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.08,0:42:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然你这么说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that you mention it, my swagger-less friend here,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.92,0:42:20.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的朋友很中意你的衬衫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he really likes that shirt you have on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.21,0:42:22.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身上这件吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, this shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.01,0:42:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.26,0:42:27.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么小他恐怕穿不下吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not entirely sure that this shirt would fit your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.18,0:42:28.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我穿的下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.34,0:42:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他需要一件不那么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs a shirt that's a little less...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.10,0:42:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休闲的衬衫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Functional.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.26,0:42:32.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 太休闲了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it, functional.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.35,0:42:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.36,0:42:43.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来拿着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll hold that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.58,0:42:44.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.36,0:42:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶紧的 时间就是金钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man, time is money.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.07,0:42:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正尽力呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, doing my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.12,0:42:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠 老兄你该褪褪毛了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, you need some hedge clippers for that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.45,0:42:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下您满意了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if that will be all...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.75,0:42:58.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裤子也脱了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the pants, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.01,0:43:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.84,0:43:10.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把那手表也那来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While you're at it, let me get that watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.18,0:43:11.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢那块表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like that watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.69,0:43:23.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这条是您的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.19,0:43:24.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这块是您的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.61,0:43:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.49,0:43:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝愉快 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good day, gentlemen. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.83,0:43:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把资料放这里了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I, um, I got the information in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.30,0:43:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能问一下你们找肖做什么吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask why you're looking for Shaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.35,0:43:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他拿了我们的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took something of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.43,0:43:59.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得和他谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd like to talk to him about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.19,0:44:01.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看我们能找到什么吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see what we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.29,0:44:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小子 你想怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.20,0:44:19.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要找一把俄罗斯的枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say if someone's looking for a Russian gun,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.75,0:44:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家说可以找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're the man to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.92,0:44:23.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, they do, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.38,0:44:28.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找麻烦吗 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want, mate?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.18,0:44:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想死就进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That might be a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.85,0:44:44.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在找这个的主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking for the owner of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.60,0:44:45.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.48,0:44:49.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看仔细再说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.86,0:44:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概一星期前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About a week ago, a girl came in,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.99,0:44:53.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个女孩来买走了所有东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bought guns, ammo, everything I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.49,0:44:55.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个女孩吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.45,0:44:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她长什么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did she look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.87,0:44:58.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瘦脸颊 深色头发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tough chick, dark hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.79,0:44:59.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身材消瘦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mean streak.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.04,0:45:02.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据说是个赛车手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Word is she's a street racer.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.42,0:45:03.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去哪能找到她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where can we find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.58,0:45:05.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么知道 我看起来像赛车手吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I know? Do I look like a racer?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.30,0:45:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确实不像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.64,0:45:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计们保重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.11,0:45:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.96,0:45:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉了女士们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.46,0:45:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.97,0:46:41.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坚持住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.14,0:46:43.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持清醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with me. Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.14,0:46:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我如何找到肖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me where to find Shaw,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.56,0:46:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会让他付出代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'll make him pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.74,0:46:56.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布拉加{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Braga...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.08,0:47:49.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 叫你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.71,0:47:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.36,0:49:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.82,0:49:19.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 还是你上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! You go!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.83,0:50:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这事谁也不能知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one needs to know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.75,0:50:49.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.27,0:51:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们失去了艾维{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost Ivory.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.73,0:51:07.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.94,0:51:09.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.24,0:51:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就说这些吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.86,0:51:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果艾维死了 那说明他犯了个错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Ivory's dead, he made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.58,0:51:22.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦犯了错误 就要付出代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you make a mistake, you pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.54,0:51:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是说得一口好悼词 肖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a great eulogy, Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.42,0:51:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们下次再外出行动时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you going to give the same speech
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.17,0:51:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也打算这么说吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the rest of us when we go out?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.32,0:51:54.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没想到你会这么多愁善感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the last one I'd have pegged to be sentimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.32,0:52:01.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢你 莱蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like you, Letty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.24,0:52:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至呆在你身边都让我觉得很温暖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dare say I even feel a certain warmth towards you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.04,0:52:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我在医院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I found you in the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.33,0:52:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现失去记忆的你时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you couldn't remember anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.92,0:52:12.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.26,0:52:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个女孩天赋异禀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"This girl has a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.42,0:52:19.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她就像一张白纸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"She's a blank page."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.80,0:52:24.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这激起了我对你的保护欲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that made me feel somewhat protective toward you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.77,0:52:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你出了什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If something happened to you, for instance,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.89,0:52:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会难以承受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I might find that slightly harder to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.15,0:52:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想说的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I'm saying is,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.82,0:52:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想看到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would hate to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.12,0:52:43.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯那种错误{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}make a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.54,0:52:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去透透气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to get some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.32,0:53:21.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.07,0:53:22.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们见过唐的女友了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We met Dom's girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.87,0:53:24.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她挺可爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.95,0:53:26.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.26,0:53:26.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.99,0:53:29.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计们 查看监控系统有什么进展吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tej, what have you got? Footage, CCTV? Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.41,0:53:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部的监控录像我都看过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just went through all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.12,0:53:31.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你敢信吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.87,0:53:33.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖的团队出现过的地方摄像头都坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everywhere Shaw's team is, the cameras are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.04,0:53:35.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是巧合吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a hell of a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.80,0:53:39.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我们得去查看一下监控中心 走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we're going to pay CCTV a little visit. Let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.42,0:53:41.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.80,0:53:44.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是给你带回来的新玩意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a new toy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.35,0:53:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.68,0:53:48.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖的人突然出现 拿着枪乱扫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaw's goons showed up and started shooting up the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.35,0:53:49.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们拿到了好东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we got something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.98,0:53:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.82,0:53:51.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布拉加{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Braga.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.77,0:53:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他和肖是合作关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's working with Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.27,0:53:57.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这话是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.57,0:54:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说的对 那人手机上的交易支付记录{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's true. That phone's filled with coded payment transactions
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.49,0:54:02.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都直指布拉加的贩毒集团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that lead straight to Braga's cartel.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.49,0:54:03.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个布拉加是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell is Braga?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.16,0:54:06.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是墨西哥最大的毒枭之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ran one of the biggest cartels in Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.08,0:54:08.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾经为他卖过命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my old boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.20,0:54:11.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也曾用他们那种密码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We used codes just like that
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.08,0:54:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把钱转移出国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to move money out of the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.33,0:54:13.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这能说的通{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It all makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.08,0:54:16.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱蒂曾被布拉加追杀 如今是肖的手下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Braga was running Letty, now he's working with Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.29,0:54:17.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布拉加和肖就是这么认识的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would explain how the two of them met.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.71,0:54:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们信息很全面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so you all know all this information about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.56,0:54:20.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们要怎么找到他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where do we find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.42,0:54:22.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在洛杉矶蹲监狱呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's sitting in a prison in Los Angeles.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.42,0:54:23.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.89,0:54:27.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是布莱恩把他关进去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brian put him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.06,0:54:29.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在就是我们的突破口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, so this is the break we were looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.97,0:54:32.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然他们在合作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the two of them were working together,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.35,0:54:33.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那布拉加一定知道肖的企图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Braga will know what Shaw's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.94,0:54:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去拜访他一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to pay him a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.31,0:54:36.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别开玩笑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you serious right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.31,0:54:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用脑子好好想想你刚刚说的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.78,0:54:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在是通缉犯 布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wanted, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.86,0:54:45.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只要一踏上美国就会被判刑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The moment you step foot off that plane, it's a wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.78,0:54:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就回不来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.16,0:54:49.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说回不来了 你怎样才能进入美国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Coming back?" How are you going to get in the country?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.70,0:54:51.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个不是问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.21,0:55:00.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.88,0:55:04.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我把布拉加抓进去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the one that served her up to Braga.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.22,0:55:08.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我要把这事办好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the one that gets to make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.72,0:55:12.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定会成功的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.73,0:55:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.32,0:55:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在可以见你了 这边请{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's ready to see you now. Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.78,0:55:29.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你能见我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for seeing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.77,0:55:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不会耽搁你太长时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't take up much of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.41,0:55:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的手下今天早些时候遭到攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My men were attacked earlier today.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.08,0:55:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要查看一下在滑铁卢车站内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to need to see all cameras
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.66,0:55:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和其周边的监控录像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in and around Waterloo station.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.42,0:55:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁来告诉这位美国队长这是需要被批准的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will somebody tell Captain America here that requires clearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.97,0:55:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terry,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.01,0:55:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把58至62号摄像机早些的录像调出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bring up cameras 58 through 62, earlier today.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.56,0:55:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些摄像机由于维修今晨全部关闭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've been down for maintenance all morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.44,0:55:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.85,0:56:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 那算了 感谢你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Well, we appreciate your help. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.61,0:56:08.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发现了一个十分有趣的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I find very interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.70,0:56:11.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国际刑警总部最近也发生了攻击事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is Interpol was attacked recently as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.66,0:56:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里的摄像机也坏了 什么都没拍到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those cameras were down, too. Didn't catch a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.20,0:56:15.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.12,0:56:17.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说 要么是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that means either
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.46,0:56:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的维修时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your maintenance schedule lines up
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.04,0:56:20.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和案件出奇的同步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}perfectly with their escape route
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.46,0:56:23.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要么就是你们这有内奸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or it's someone here that's working with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.38,0:56:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过这事也太扯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's just ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.09,0:56:27.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为说到你们这有内奸的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because there ain't no way in hell
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.30,0:56:29.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}anybody here would be working for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.80,0:56:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更不会是你 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Particularly you, ain't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.51,0:56:33.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 这太扯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, that's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.68,0:56:35.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 的确很扯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.31,0:56:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要获取你的所有监控信号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to need direct access to your live feed
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.19,0:56:39.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要全市范围的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}citywide.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.35,0:56:42.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我强烈建议你这次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I also strongly suggest that you put a hold on any more
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.65,0:56:43.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暂停你们的维修工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Maintenance."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.98,0:56:45.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.28,0:56:48.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十分感谢你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We appreciate your help. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.01,0:57:03.69,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,(洛杉矶)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.13,0:57:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看啊看啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.63,0:57:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你穿橘色很适合啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The orange in that really makes your eyes pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.60,0:57:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.52,0:57:22.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我说说 奥康纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me something, O'Conner,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.40,0:57:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你满世界逃窜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how is it you keep running around the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.32,0:57:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不断寻找法律的漏洞 可是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}breaking every law known to man,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.69,0:57:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我现在把你抓住了呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and yet here I am, putting my job on the line for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.61,0:57:29.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我把抓住肖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll feel a lot better
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.58,0:57:31.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,归功于你怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}once you get the credit for taking down Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.28,0:57:34.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住你我已经很满意了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm tempted to settle for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.03,0:57:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗 斯塔夏克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you know what they say, Stasiak,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.24,0:57:38.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是想抓个大人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you want the career-changing big fish,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.87,0:57:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就该懂得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you got to be willing to put on the big boy panties
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.62,0:57:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舍不得孩子套不着狼的道理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sail out to the deep water.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.75,0:57:44.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're an asshole, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.13,0:57:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想死你了伙计 真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I missed you, too, man. I really missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.68,0:57:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你做的假身份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you admitted
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.73,0:57:56.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让你做你该做的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into Victorville to do whatever you got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.68,0:57:58.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,24小时拘留{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a 24-hour hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.43,0:58:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天9点你前必须逃出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to be out of there by 9:00 a.M.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.27,0:58:01.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的指纹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's when Forensics will run
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.55,0:58:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会被输入国家指纹库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your fingerprints through the national database.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.77,0:58:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指纹库会开始匹配你的指纹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That program will match you
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.69,0:58:07.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但当他们发现你的真实身份后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and when they find out who you really are,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.53,0:58:09.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连我都没法把你救出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't be able to get you back out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.86,0:58:11.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,监狱生活可是水深火热{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're talking life in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.99,0:58:20.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你孩子很可爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cute kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.17,0:58:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布拉加被关在监狱D-3区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I found out Braga's being held in cell block D3.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.92,0:58:29.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是单独的房间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's solitary.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.13,0:58:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只能把你安排在普通狱区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only had enough juice to get you in Gen Pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.97,0:58:36.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你得有所行动让他注意到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're going to have to do something to get his attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.22,0:58:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉了伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about this, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.35,0:58:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.48,0:58:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.04,0:59:02.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看现场直播咯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big Brother's about to go live.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.04,0:59:08.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在伦敦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, you can't flick a
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.09,0:59:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想偷偷摸摸干点事情还真难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}booger in London without somebody noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.88,0:59:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别乱碰 那可不是用来玩的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Don't touch that. That's nothing to play with, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.72,0:59:17.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.76,0:59:19.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可是高张量钛电缆做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's high-tensile titanium cable.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.51,0:59:21.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.56,0:59:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是打地基和撑桥梁的材料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what they use to anchor buildings and hold up bridges,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.73,0:59:25.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不懂别乱碰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stuff you know nothing about!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.90,0:59:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们做的版本 只能说是过得去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, now, their version, it works cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.52,0:59:31.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的可是大师手笔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but mine, masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.59,0:59:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看我把齿轮安到发动机后面去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I reversed the gears, torqued the motor
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.88,0:59:37.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在后面加上了这个罐子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and added this tank to the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.39,0:59:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就让我更想玩一把了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That makes it even sweeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.72,0:59:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是真枪实弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.89,0:59:42.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是模型{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not dummy-proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.27,0:59:44.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道怎么操作大型枪支 放松点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, I've been known to handle big guns. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.60,0:59:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个你可不会用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been known to handle that big-ass head.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.73,0:59:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唐 我做了点调查 询问了下周边情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom, I did some checking, asked around,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.57,0:59:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了一处可以赛车的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}got the location of a street race tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.63,0:59:55.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四辆雪弗兰美式超跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four speed Camaro SS big block.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.30,0:59:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帅吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.01,0:59:59.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,颜色真帅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice color.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.53,1:00:50.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布莱恩·奥康纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brian O'Conner.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.62,1:00:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是巧遇啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was quite an entrance.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.88,1:01:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你抓了怎么多人进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You put a lot of these men in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.42,1:01:04.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么 你觉得没人能认出你来吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? You didn't think one would recognize you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.97,1:01:09.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家可都记着你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've kept tabs on you, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.31,1:01:12.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在外面玩的很开心啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been having a lot of fun out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.77,1:01:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在里约热内卢时你变成了个坏警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good cop gone bad, Rio de Janeiro.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.69,1:01:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯罪的感觉是不是很爽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's exciting when you go criminal, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.27,1:01:22.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是早点变成坏警察就可以为我干事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too bad you didn't do it earlier, you could have worked for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.49,1:01:24.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像莱蒂·奥蒂斯一样是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Letty Ortiz?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.32,1:01:28.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我点她的事 因为我亲手埋葬了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So tell me something, because I buried her.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.49,1:01:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? You did?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.16,1:01:32.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么知道你埋了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You buried something, I couldn't tell you who or what it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.25,1:01:36.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道她为肖工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know she's running with Owen Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.79,1:01:39.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布莱恩你还是有颗警察心啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still playing cop, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.63,1:01:43.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就凭你的等级还不配知道这些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me, this is way above your pay grade.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.97,1:01:46.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别嘲笑我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humor me, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.30,1:01:50.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正你也是行尸走肉了 告诉你也无妨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're a dead man walking, what does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.31,1:01:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我替肖打理一切事物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ran everything for Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.31,1:01:57.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毒品 枪支 金钱 女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drugs, guns, money, women.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.98,1:02:00.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我眼光狭隘时他教会我把目光放远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He taught me to think global when I was just local.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.98,1:02:02.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我变富了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He made me a wealthy man.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.65,1:02:04.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不仅他的毒品集团为我工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this guy didn't just have the cartels working for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.78,1:02:09.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中情局 缉毒局 他控制着所有人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had the CIA, DEA, everyone in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.66,1:02:11.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他比他们更早掌握第一手消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knew what was going to happen before they did.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.91,1:02:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上他早就知道乳臭未干的FBI探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, he even knew when some wet-behind-the-ears FBI agent
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.66,1:02:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打算把卧底安排进我的毒品集团的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}decided to put some informant in my cartel.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.85,1:02:35.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让莱蒂做卧底结果害死了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The minute you put Letty undercover, she was dead, bro.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.22,1:03:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她活下来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.06,1:03:17.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这女孩命真硬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That girl is one tough bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.39,1:03:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖两天后在医院找到她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaw found her in a hospital two days later.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.73,1:03:22.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打算杀了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went to finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.11,1:03:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他为什么没杀她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he didn't kill her. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.90,1:03:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她失忆了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had no memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.78,1:03:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直太完美了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect girl, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.49,1:03:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该庆幸我们之间有道门隔着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lucky this door's between us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.04,1:03:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得为莱蒂的事负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to Letty is on your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.08,1:04:30.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着我 看着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me! Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.46,1:04:33.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会杀我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.96,1:04:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖到底有什么企图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is Shaw up to?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.63,1:04:39.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对你的行动了如指掌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you think he knows your next move before you make it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.80,1:04:41.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一直监视着你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got eyes on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.51,1:04:43.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想想吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.26,1:04:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非他想见你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only way you get close to Shaw
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.93,1:04:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则你无法接近他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is if he wants you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.62,1:06:37.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你胆子还真大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got some serious balls, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.00,1:06:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都这么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been told.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.34,1:06:42.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很幸运我上次没射中你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you're lucky I missed my shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.09,1:06:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你打得挺准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you hit your mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.59,1:06:45.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.76,1:06:47.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底想干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.05,1:06:49.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想活了还是怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you got a death wish or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.09,1:06:51.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么大不了的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.85,1:06:53.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是想赛一局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to race.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.18,1:06:56.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有可能会输掉你的车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might lose your car.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.69,1:07:02.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来赛一局吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.61,1:07:04.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.07,1:07:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还记得吗 要么赛车要么死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ride or die, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.95,1:07:17.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都听好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.83,1:07:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在这里追寻我们心之所向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out here, we're used to getting what we want.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.50,1:07:21.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是伦敦 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is London, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.21,1:07:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但记住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But remember,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.46,1:07:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别轻易上钩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't bite the bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.05,1:07:29.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们准备好了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.64,1:07:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.76,1:07:32.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.85,1:07:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稳住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.81,1:07:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.45,1:08:34.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直是重温以前的时光啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.00,1:09:24.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙真疯狂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.83,1:10:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.82,1:10:37.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你换挡还是太早了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're still upshifting early.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.49,1:10:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样才能逼你刹车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do that so you brake.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.83,1:10:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样车尾就会打滑失控{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lose traction and the back end kicks out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.83,1:10:45.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我注意到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.42,1:10:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我开车的习惯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, just because you know how I ride,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.76,1:10:51.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不代表你了解我本人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doesn't mean you know me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.42,1:10:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那句话是怎么说的来着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what they say where we're from?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.59,1:10:58.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飙车给我看看 我会让你知道自己是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me how you drive, I'll show you who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.01,1:11:01.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,V8汽缸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}V8.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.51,1:11:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是那么喜欢美国肌肉车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never could resist American muscle.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.19,1:11:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤疤挺漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.69,1:11:18.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是爱到处惹麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never could keep yourself out of trouble, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.37,1:11:23.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还知道什么关于我的事儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else do you know about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.87,1:11:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.83,1:11:30.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我了解你的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.22,1:11:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如这条疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like this scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.55,1:11:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是在咱俩第一次遇到那晚留下的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got that the first night we met.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.15,1:11:43.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时你才15岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were 15.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.30,1:11:45.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次参加绕圈赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First street race.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.39,1:11:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个想要出风头的小屁孩儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some kid trying to show off lost control of his car,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.48,1:11:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飙车失控了 车就在你身旁撞毁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wiped out right next to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.11,1:11:55.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没卸下你一条胳膊已经是万幸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lucky you didn't lose your arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.73,1:11:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜猜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And let me guess,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.90,1:11:59.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你救了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.90,1:12:01.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.07,1:12:04.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是那个想出风头的小屁孩儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was the kid showing off.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.41,1:12:08.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.25,1:12:17.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博伊尔高地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boyle Heights.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.09,1:12:20.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在和我妹妹飙车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were fleeing with my little sister Mia
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.50,1:12:22.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被她逼得手忙脚乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and got trapped in a corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.18,1:12:25.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得飙着你的福特眼镜蛇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you thought it was a good idea
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.76,1:12:29.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿墙而过是个绝佳的主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to ride your Torino Cobra through a retaining wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.02,1:12:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 那这条呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, how about this one?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.44,1:12:42.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们最后一次在一起的时候弄的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the last time we were together.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.12,1:12:46.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在DR时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the DR.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.12,1:12:49.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说你想晚上游泳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted to go for a night swim.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.96,1:12:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果被暗礁划伤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cut yourself on the reef.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.33,1:12:55.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一路跟着你游{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I followed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.13,1:12:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以也被划了一道一模一样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I even got this scar to match.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.47,1:13:04.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你为什么会出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I don't know why you're here,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.80,1:13:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你肯定病的不轻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I really think you're over your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.06,1:13:18.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是为你而来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.32,1:13:24.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你记忆里的那个女孩儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That girl you remember,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.24,1:13:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并不是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.58,1:13:32.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只相信刚才亲眼所见的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not from what I just saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.42,1:13:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随你怎么想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like it or not,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.25,1:13:39.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你一点也没变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're still the same girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.13,1:13:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前我就知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw it out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.10,1:13:49.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在更是坚信不疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see it right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.10,1:13:53.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.57,1:14:09.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.78,1:14:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There she goes,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.57,1:14:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又一次离开了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}leaving you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.28,1:14:51.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真他妈的绝情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bloody fickle, that one.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.24,1:14:54.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想来血腥暴力的我奉陪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want bloody? We could do bloody.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.87,1:14:59.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个街头小混混{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A street kid,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.38,1:15:03.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在洛杉矶东部卖唱片机白手起家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}starts out stealing DVD players in East L.A.,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.84,1:15:08.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后则在里约偷了一亿然后金盆洗手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ends up heisting $100 million in Rio.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.55,1:15:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不错吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.22,1:15:12.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个美满的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good story, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.39,1:15:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直让人羡慕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost inspiring.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.56,1:15:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不明白的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, what I couldn't fathom is
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.44,1:15:21.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为啥他不愿意和那个美貌的巴西小妞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why he's not relaxing on a beach somewhere
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.73,1:15:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安心在某个世外桃源隐居终老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with that cute little Brazilian number.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.15,1:15:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却要和政府的鹰爪霍布斯共事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead, he's working with a two-bit government hack like Hobbs.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.91,1:15:34.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我发现了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I realized,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.16,1:15:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有一个弱点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he has a weak spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.46,1:15:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都有弱点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all got a weak spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.75,1:15:46.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我年轻时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, when I was young,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.52,1:15:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我堂弟常说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my brother always used to say,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.84,1:15:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都有自己的代名词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Every man has to have a code."
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.35,1:15:54.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.10,1:15:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缜密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precision.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.89,1:15:59.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在任务完成之前整个团队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A team is nothing but pieces
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.44,1:16:01.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过是分工合作的部件罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you switch out until you get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.94,1:16:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高效{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's efficient.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.77,1:16:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且实用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It works.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.11,1:16:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.95,1:16:11.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你却对错误的信念忠贞不渝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're loyal to a fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.49,1:16:14.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的代名词和"家人"息息相关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your code is about family.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.16,1:16:17.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在闲暇之余可能还不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's great in the holidays,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.99,1:16:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这也让我能轻松料到你的行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it makes you predictable.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.79,1:16:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而这就代表着你很脆弱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in our line of work, predictable means vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.46,1:16:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说只要我想 随时都能打垮你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that means I can reach out and break you whenever I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.42,1:16:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但至少我知道我最终为何而死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least when I go, I'll know what it's for.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.80,1:16:35.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少你还有个代名词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, at least you have a code.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.56,1:16:38.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大多数人都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most men don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.98,1:16:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我给你一个机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I'm going to give you a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.82,1:16:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带着你的团队走人吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your crew and walk away.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.07,1:16:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是唯一能保你整个家族周全的法子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the only way you're going to keep your family safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.28,1:16:59.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你弟没教过你别拿家人作威胁人的筹码吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your brother never told you never to threaten a man's family?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.00,1:17:03.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我承认是做了件傻事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a pretty stupid thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.42,1:17:07.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我也开门见山地说吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'll make it simple for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.17,1:17:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她和这事儿脱了干系后我才会罢休{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I walk away when she walks away.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.68,1:17:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.01,1:17:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来这个令人羡慕的故事要走到头了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it appears this inspiring tale has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.98,1:17:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你真打算这么干的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's the way it has to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.74,1:17:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我猜猜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.12,1:17:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是霍布斯吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hobbs.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.54,1:17:47.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放马过来 王八蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.79,1:17:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,政府的鹰爪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The "Two-bit government hack."
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.22,1:17:58.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再会了 托雷托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you around, Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.06,1:18:00.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会再见的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can bet on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.28,1:18:18.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱利 肖驱车从巴特西往东南方向逃走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riley, Shaw's leaving Battersea, heading southeast.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.58,1:18:20.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让泰吉去追踪他的车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have Tej track him on his live feed. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.87,1:18:22.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what would have happened
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.95,1:18:25.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我没在你车里放跟踪器会怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I didn't put that tracker in your car?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.88,1:18:29.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.43,1:18:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这玩意儿让我离抓到肖又进了一步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, this just got me one step closer to Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.93,1:18:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论如何 托雷托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what it's worth, Toretto,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.18,1:18:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你也能早点实现你的目的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope it gets you closer to what you want, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.95,1:19:03.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么做最好值得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This better have been worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.29,1:19:06.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是值了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More than you'll ever know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.04,1:19:54.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.13,1:20:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能给我看看吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.23,1:20:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得问你个问题 莱蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to ask you a question, Letty,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.74,1:20:21.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你三思之后再回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I want you to think very hard before you answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.16,1:20:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我下令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I give you the order
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.87,1:20:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你杀了托雷托时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to take Toretto out,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.87,1:20:31.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你脑海中的第一反应是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what will your first thought be?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.13,1:20:35.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么不看着我的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you look me in the eye
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.67,1:20:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后告诉我你看到了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you tell me what you see.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.52,1:20:50.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留着吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.70,1:21:02.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快说说情况如何了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tej, talk to me, what have we got?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.86,1:21:05.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是能追踪到肖了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were able to track Shaw after he left you and Dom,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.37,1:21:06.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他也学聪明了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this guy's smart,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.36,1:21:07.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们也只能追踪到那么远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we could only track him so far.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.16,1:21:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他知道城里所有摄像头的盲区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He seems to know all the city's blind spots.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.71,1:21:12.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在这一带跟丢了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, we lost him somewhere in here,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.17,1:21:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他可能在这附近半英里的范围内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which means he could be anywhere within that half-a-mile radius.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.29,1:21:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我们排查一下通话记录和租房信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe if we cross-reference phone records, leases...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.38,1:21:20.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 这就是肖的行事风格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, this has got Shaw's name written all over it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.59,1:21:22.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一段岔路极多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got vantage points, multiple exits,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.80,1:21:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有地铁 高速路和下水道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}subways, highways and storm drains.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.51,1:21:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真伤脑筋啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad-ass and brains.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.10,1:21:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你再说下去我只有下岗了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woman, you keep that up, I'm going to be out of a job.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.56,1:21:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 咱们去抓那个王八蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's go nail that son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.96,1:21:56.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们早就走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're long gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.54,1:21:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿什么都没剩下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.72,1:22:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不尽然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's never nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.27,1:22:18.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总会有些蛛丝马迹的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's always something.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.70,1:22:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发吧伙计们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.91,1:22:32.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖 全员就位 一切照计划进行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaw, everyone is in place. All things moving according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.29,1:22:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 让他们上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Send him in.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.59,1:22:42.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍布斯打来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, it's Hobbs.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.97,1:22:46.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么发现 帕克 给我些好消息吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you got, Parker? Give me something good.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.38,1:22:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有 你在肖的地盘找到的涂料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that paint you got from Shaw's place
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.69,1:22:49.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是专门定制的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is highly specialized.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.14,1:22:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以防止雷达侦测的涂料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anti-thermal low-IR coating.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.47,1:22:53.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,军用涂料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Military.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.84,1:22:54.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.60,1:22:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一清单欧洲军事基地都在用这种涂料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a list of bases around Europe that use this paint type
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.44,1:22:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有特定的颜色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and those specific colors.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.77,1:23:01.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就通查一遍所有肖的军事目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's cross-reference that with all of Shaw's military targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.15,1:23:04.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总会有吻合的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guaran-damn-tee you one of them is gonna match.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.82,1:23:06.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.49,1:23:09.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是西班牙的一个北约军事基地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a NATO base in Spain.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.32,1:23:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那意味着肖去了别的国家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That puts Shaw in a different country.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.24,1:23:12.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样他已经领先我们8个小时了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means he's got an eight-hour lead on us.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.91,1:23:13.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们现在就该动身了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta move now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.85,1:23:15.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰吉 把数据传给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tej, give me that info.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.41,1:23:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱利和我现在就去锁定那个基地的位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riley and I will go ahead and we're going to lock down the base.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.75,1:23:19.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得靠自己去保护那个装置了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to protect that component personally.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.00,1:23:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托雷托 立即把你的人和车调过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toretto, I'll arrange transportation for you and your cars.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.88,1:23:26.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换上你的西班牙装备 咱们西班牙见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You brush up on your Spanish, boys. I'll see you en EspaГ±a.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.77,1:23:33.73,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,(西班牙 鲁斯塔尼恩 北约基地)
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.20,1:23:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你个狗娘养的 居然成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You son of a bitch! You made it!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.66,1:23:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别来无恙啊 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What up, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.50,1:23:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.16,1:23:56.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是 这是要干什么去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you. So, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.70,1:23:58.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查出他们要袭击西班牙的一个军事基地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Figured out they're hitting an army base in Spain.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.67,1:24:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖的手下夜里越过了边境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Border patrol ID'ed Shaw's men crossing through last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.50,1:24:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍布斯和莱利先去警告对方了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hobbs and Riley went to lock down the base.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.75,1:24:04.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在那边汇合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're going to meet us there.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.69,1:24:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唐在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Dom?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.34,1:24:07.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没回来他不愿意走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't going without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.30,1:24:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我查清楚莱蒂身上到底发生了什么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found out what happened to Letty.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.18,1:24:18.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.23,1:24:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brian,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.27,1:24:23.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论你查到了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whatever you found out,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.22,1:24:24.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都只是为你自己而查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.19,1:24:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我们现在要做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we're about to do now
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.61,1:24:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是要让她回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.87,1:24:35.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们设置了四支小队警戒巡逻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got four teams on overwatch,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.08,1:24:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标周围的制高点也安插了狙击手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sniper-spotters in roosts north and south of the target.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.04,1:24:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你的人都调开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just keep all your men out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.62,1:24:41.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们开着卡车冲进来时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they drive that truck in here,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.79,1:24:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望能像推倒耶利哥之墙那样碾碎他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to come crashing down on them like the walls of Jericho.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.59,1:24:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍布斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hobbs,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.02,1:24:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙想关闭保卫系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just caught this one disabling the perimeter security system.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.26,1:24:50.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的基地已经不安全了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your house is compromised.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.38,1:24:51.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么建议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you suggesting?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.63,1:24:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是在提建议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't suggesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.76,1:24:54.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按着计划来 我们把目标转移出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We follow protocol, we move the component out.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.14,1:24:55.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖以为东西在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaw thinks it's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.98,1:24:57.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要在肖到这儿前把目标转移走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to get it out of here before he arrives.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.14,1:25:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们最需要的就是隐蔽和快速{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stealth and speed are going to be our two best friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.10,1:25:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先把鸡蛋从鸡窝里拿出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to protect our little egg, move it out of the henhouse,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.44,1:25:05.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再等着那狡猾的老狐狸自投罗网{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then we're going to wait for that goddamn fox to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.78,1:25:11.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在基地里抓住了一个肖的手下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just got word they caught one of Shaw's men at the base.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.74,1:25:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.03,1:25:14.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉不大对劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something is not right.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.59,1:25:16.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他故意让我们发现那个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted us to find that guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.83,1:25:19.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还记得在国际刑警总部 你们对上他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about it. At Interpol, you were face-to-face with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.46,1:25:21.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布莱恩 那你说怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brian, so what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.21,1:25:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布拉加说找到肖的唯一途径就是等他来找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Braga said the only way you get near Shaw is if he wants you to.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.88,1:25:29.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰吉 装置现在在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tej, where's that component?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.09,1:25:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正被运往一处安全的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're moving it to a secure location.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.72,1:25:38.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖的目的不是要袭击那个基地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaw ain't hitting that base.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.56,1:25:39.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是想引出运输车队中途拦截{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's hitting the convoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.26,1:26:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.04,1:26:47.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告说运输车队受到攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got a report, the convoy's under attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.21,1:26:48.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上直升机 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a chopper, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.89,1:27:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们最好快点 他们已经控制了车队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fellas, you better hurry up. They just took the convoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.90,1:27:12.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 唐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Dom,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.48,1:27:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱蒂也来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letty's with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.74,1:27:17.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切照计划实施{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We stick to the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.75,1:27:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家听好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you heard the man.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.91,1:27:26.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们要干净利落地解决这事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's play this fast and clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.16,1:27:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标正前往你们所在的路上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing's heading your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.37,1:28:06.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有系统就绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All systems go.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.70,1:28:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切就绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything looks stable.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.37,1:28:11.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计们 我们得另想一个计划了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, guys, we gotta come up with another plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.88,1:28:15.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们整了辆坦克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got a tank.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.05,1:28:18.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 刚才是有人说什么"坦克"吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, did somebody just say  "a tank"?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.72,1:28:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们有伴儿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got company, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.14,1:28:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托雷托冲你来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toretto is coming right at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.56,1:28:31.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Get the weapons hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.73,1:28:34.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把卫星影像传输给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me satellite imaging.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.75,1:29:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在正前方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Straight ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.29,1:29:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.60,1:29:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁有B计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's got a plan B?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.10,1:29:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B计划吗 B计划哪够{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plan B? Plan B?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.43,1:29:51.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还需要C计划 D计划 E计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a plan C, D, E.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.81,1:29:52.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,字母表都不够用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need more alphabets!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.14,1:29:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我们尽力吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, we do what we do best.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.44,1:29:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随机应变行了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We improvise, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.17,1:30:17.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶和华 去另一边车道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Jah. Take it to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.34,1:30:18.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来玩点儿刺激的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.52,1:30:37.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你他妈的是不是有病 这不在计划里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is wrong with you? This isn't part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.83,1:30:51.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他们的注意力从无辜的人身上引开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take their attention away from the people!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.05,1:31:06.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖 你没必要做的这么绝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaw, you don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.90,1:31:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们前面有个送上门来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got one right in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.86,1:31:23.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真他妈见鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.20,1:31:32.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可真是狗屎运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lucky bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.70,1:31:35.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗姆 挺住啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roman, you hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.50,1:31:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坚持住 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang in there, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.50,1:31:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们谁来做点什么 有辆坦克咬我屁股{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody better do something! I got a tank on my ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.51,1:31:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面有个缺口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's gotta be a break up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.60,1:31:53.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, look,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.72,1:31:55.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个桥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.92,1:32:26.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管他娘的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screw it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.17,1:33:05.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们后面拖着辆车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're dragging a car behind us.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.46,1:33:09.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布莱恩 我们必须得去给他们点儿回报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brian, that Mustang would make a nice anchor.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.30,1:33:10.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这就去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.70,1:33:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.87,1:33:38.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖 我们得摆脱后面那辆车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaw, we've got to get rid of that car.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.79,1:33:41.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱蒂 你来解决那难缠的缆线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letty, go take care of the cable.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.73,1:34:02.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.23,1:34:03.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.27,1:34:05.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在轮到你了 托雷托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.53,1:34:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的女人在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's your girl...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.70,1:34:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来个幸福结局吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.45,1:34:15.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letty!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.94,1:34:53.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的老天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.83,1:35:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难以置信他们偷了辆70吨的坦克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe they stole a 70-ton tank
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.12,1:35:04.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只为了得到三盎司电脑芯片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a three-ounce computer chip.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.58,1:35:06.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那三盎司电脑芯片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That 3-ounce computer chip
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.09,1:35:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比坦克要致命上千倍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is more deadly than 1,000 of those tanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.01,1:35:13.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那她呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about her?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.13,1:35:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not her.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.97,1:35:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她为肖卖命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was working with Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.59,1:35:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经过去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.81,1:35:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一直是我们中的一员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but she's always been one of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.81,1:35:27.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他们点时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's give them a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.70,1:35:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得对付肖的同伙们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go process Shaw and his crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.83,1:35:44.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要写的报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never looked more
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.89,1:35:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这辈子都写不完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}forward to filling out paperwork in my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.35,1:36:11.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么跟你说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I don't even know how to say this to you,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.40,1:36:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这一切都因我而起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but everything that's happened here is because of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.36,1:36:20.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪我你才落到如此境地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the one that put you undercover...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.87,1:36:22.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.54,1:36:25.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我虽然之前的事都不记得了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may not remember anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.45,1:36:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我确定我自己的一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I know one thing about myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.54,1:36:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是没有人能强迫我做我不想做的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody makes me do anything I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.18,1:36:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这之后的下一段冒险你想去哪儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's our next adventure after this?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.27,1:36:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起度过如何{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about we stay in one place?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.77,1:36:55.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想去哪儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.15,1:36:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东京{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.36,1:37:00.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们总是聊到东京{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We always talk about Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.99,1:37:04.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就去东京吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tokyo it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.87,1:37:13.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能问你点事吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.51,1:37:22.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know that
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.86,1:37:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那有辆车会接住我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there would be a car there to break our fall?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.60,1:37:28.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.06,1:37:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时你只需依靠信念{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some things you just have to take on faith.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.32,1:37:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托雷托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Toretto!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.90,1:37:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来听一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to hear this.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.46,1:37:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不会真以为你们赢了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys really think you've won.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.46,1:38:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你们崇尚的忠诚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This code you live by,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.97,1:38:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你们到现在都搞不清状况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's the very reason why you weren't even in the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.81,1:38:09.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟你说过我会做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you exactly what I was gonna do
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.05,1:38:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不退出 托雷托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you didn't walk away, Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.18,1:38:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.10,1:38:14.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你不听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you didn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.48,1:38:19.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过我随时能摧毁你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you I can reach out and break you whenever I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.28,1:38:23.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我已经做到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I have.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.99,1:38:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.16,1:38:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.12,1:38:29.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.54,1:38:31.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你该给米娅打个电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you should call Mia.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.39,1:38:46.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米娅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mia?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.22,1:38:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brian!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.35,1:38:51.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.99,1:39:07.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这笔交易算是成交了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, this is how it's gonna go down.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.24,1:39:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖帮我把手铐解开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna cut me loose from these cuffs,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.66,1:39:11.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把芯片交给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're gonna hand me the chip,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.08,1:39:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我安全出去 不许跟踪我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna walk out of here and you're not gonna follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.25,1:39:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你开什么玩笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be joking.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.42,1:39:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看他的表情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at his face.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.68,1:39:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问问他我是不是在开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask him if I'm joking.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.22,1:39:31.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一名人质的安危无法和百万市民匹敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One hostage does not outweigh the threat to millions.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.02,1:39:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 这对我来说没影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, but this changes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.86,1:39:43.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是对我们有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.57,1:39:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你命令你的人退下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell your men to stand down.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.07,1:39:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.20,1:39:55.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托雷托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toretto,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.25,1:39:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to know,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.75,1:40:01.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们让他带着芯片出了那扇门的一刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the moment we let him walk out that door with that chip,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.38,1:40:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"撤销""赦免"什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}words like  "Amnesty" And  "Pardon"...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.59,1:40:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可就都没了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}walk out with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.93,1:40:15.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们生来就跟这个没缘分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those words went out the day we were born.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.13,1:40:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 宝贝儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming, babe?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.30,1:40:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.47,1:40:57.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不想错过这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't miss it for the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.90,1:41:02.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像我刚刚说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I said,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.07,1:41:06.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你永远赢不了这场游戏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you were never in the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.19,1:41:08.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快我们还会见面的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I see you on the horizon,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.90,1:41:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会打电话叫他们别弄死那女的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll make the call and the girl's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.50,1:41:26.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托雷托的妹妹怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what about Toretto's sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.42,1:41:30.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留着她没用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no need for her anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.68,1:41:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚刚把这片区域发出的信号都锁定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just jammed every signal up and down the spectrum.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.85,1:41:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.69,1:41:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和你们一起去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.14,1:42:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙到底想往哪里跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell does this dude think he's going?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.23,1:42:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被困在这个军事基地了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on an army base, he's trapped.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.57,1:42:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你个乌鸦嘴能闭上吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, you just had to open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.11,1:42:35.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们有个大飞机要对付{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we got a big-ass plane to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.28,1:42:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是架飞机 简直是个星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ain't a plane. That's a planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.76,1:42:44.05,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,打开货舱门
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.43,1:42:58.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果肖上飞机逃了你妹妹就死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's as good as dead if Shaw gets away on that plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.02,1:43:03.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不会让他逃走的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we don't let him get away.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.61,1:43:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在就搞定他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's end this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.33,1:43:23.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不飙宁死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ride or die.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.66,1:43:25.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不飙宁死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ride or die.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.38,1:44:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们起飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them to take off!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.14,1:44:56.81,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,起飞 起飞
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.89,1:44:58.98,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,已经超载了 我们要提速
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.60,1:45:04.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝 送我到机翼下面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Babe, get me under the wing.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.06,1:45:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我能击中副翼 就能阻止它起飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I can hit that flap, we can keep it from taking off.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.56,1:45:13.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小心点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.73,1:45:16.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我们的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is who we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.75,1:45:29.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.34,1:45:31.51,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,外面发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.42,1:45:34.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,握紧方向盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab the wheel!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.14,1:46:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.52,1:46:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.81,1:46:35.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.33,1:46:52.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先进车里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.03,1:48:44.78,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,够起飞速度了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.78,1:48:45.63,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,那就起飞吧
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.28,1:50:04.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了 你击中了飞机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened? Did you hit the flap?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.24,1:50:08.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好系好安全带{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should buckle up right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.74,1:50:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.80,1:50:31.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站错队了 婊子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong team, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.55,1:51:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.96,1:51:57.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抓住你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.96,1:52:25.38,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,他们击中了副翼
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.38,1:52:26.84,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要把我们拖垮了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.37,1:52:58.37,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,抬高 抬高
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.62,1:53:06.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰吉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tej!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.12,1:53:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持这个速度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep her steady!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.87,1:53:10.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走 飞机要坠毁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta move, it's going down!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.53,1:53:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.50,1:53:17.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走 现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.51,1:53:22.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跳 快跳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.72,1:53:29.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.81,1:53:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.25,1:56:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉赛尔呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Gisele?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.88,1:56:47.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉赛尔去哪儿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Gisele?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.78,1:57:19.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这东西值十几亿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is worth billions, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.37,1:57:25.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 就是它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.59,1:57:31.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开个价吧 唐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Name your price, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.80,1:57:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1327{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1327.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.25,1:58:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次别烧焦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't burn it this time. Please?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.17,1:58:09.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么时候烧焦过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never go and burn it, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.67,1:58:13.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有好吃的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good food.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.76,1:58:17.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空气质量不好 交通状况也很差{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The air quality here is lousy, the traffic is bad,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.68,1:58:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我觉得你会喜欢这地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I think you'll learn to like this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.51,1:58:23.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都有自己的车库了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and here you've got your own garage
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.14,1:58:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以和老爹一起改车了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you can build a car with Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.19,1:58:26.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起来改车吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be building a car?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.35,1:58:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一辆车最好是道奇Charger 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First car better be a Charger, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.86,1:58:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是天际才对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean Skyline.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.36,1:58:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过他是托雷托家的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I said, he's a Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.86,1:58:36.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝宝都凌乱了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're confusing the kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.36,1:58:37.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米娅 你就这么由着他吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mia, you're gonna let him get away with this?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.70,1:58:39.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真要这样吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're really going to do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.95,1:58:40.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去东京{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.20,1:58:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有事要处理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's just something I gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.04,1:58:48.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是知道我们会支持你的 随叫随到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know we got your back, whenever you need us.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.46,1:58:54.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米娅 快把婴儿润肤油藏起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Mia, you better hide your baby oil.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.96,1:58:56.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开个玩笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just playing.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.05,1:58:57.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好藏起脸上那张大屁股{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better hide that big-ass forehead.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.88,1:58:59.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是个玩笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just joking, but whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.64,1:59:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没那么好笑好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely not that funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.22,1:59:02.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是官方文件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's official.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.06,1:59:04.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都被赦免了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all free.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:08.23,1:59:10.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有你替我效力也挺不错的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't half bad, having you work for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.07,1:59:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明就是你在为我服务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all know you were working for me, Hobbs.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.07,1:59:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各抒己见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agree to disagree.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.53,1:59:19.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.53,1:59:21.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.41,1:59:24.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃琳娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elena?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.58,1:59:25.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letty.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.75,1:59:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是有多尴尬啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna be awkward.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.25,1:59:30.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过太他妈性感了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But sexy as hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.08,1:59:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你为他 为我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to thank you for everything you've done for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.55,1:59:35.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For us.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.42,1:59:38.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个出色的女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It takes an amazing woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.39,1:59:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个不错的男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's an amazing guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.60,1:59:44.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的确是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.60,1:59:47.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让他再惹麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to keep him out of trouble, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.27,1:59:51.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道那一定不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you know that's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.77,1:59:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.90,1:59:59.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对警察来说不错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not bad for a cop.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.83,2:00:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来没想过我会信任一个罪犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought I'd trust a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.33,2:00:14.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后会有期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until next time.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.67,2:00:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后会有期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until next time.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.85,2:00:24.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃琳娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elena.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.77,2:00:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道你不必离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you don't have to go.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.19,2:00:41.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 这些都是你的家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All this... This is your family.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.70,2:00:44.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真实的你自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's who you are.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.95,2:00:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而这才是我的家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my family.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.16,2:00:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真正的我自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is who I am.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.22,2:01:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开饭啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, everybody, let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.89,2:01:11.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要帮忙吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want some help with that?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.14,2:01:13.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菜都上了 可以开饭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all here, it's done.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.52,2:01:16.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来 伙计 我们一起把这些消灭掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man, let's get with it.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.73,2:01:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃了第一口 由他来做祷告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First bite, he's got grace.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.57,2:01:23.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,房屋守则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}House rules, man. House rules.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.66,2:01:28.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这感觉熟悉吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any of this feel familiar to you?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.37,2:01:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.54,2:01:38.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但有家的感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it feels like home.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.50,2:01:40.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样我已经很满足了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.63,2:01:44.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来吧 要开动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, y'all. Come on, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.01,2:01:46.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Roman,
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.43,2:01:50.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来祷告吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bless our table.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.85,2:01:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主啊 谢谢你让我们朋友团聚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, thank you for the gathering of friends.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.27,2:02:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主啊 感谢我们所得的选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, we give thanks for all the choices we've made,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.24,2:02:04.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为那些成就了今天的我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because that's what makes us who we are.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.99,2:02:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会永远珍惜一路上我们所痛失的爱人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us forever cherish the loved ones we've lost along the way.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.87,2:02:10.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢小天使的降临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for the little angel,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.49,2:02:12.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为大家庭添加一名新成员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the newest addition to our family.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.62,2:02:14.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢您将莱蒂带回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for bringing Letty home.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.62,2:02:18.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最重要的是 谢谢您赐予的跑车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And most of all, thank you for fast cars.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.94,2:03:06.27,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,(东京)
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.19,2:03:11.44,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,路上车辆请注意
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.61,2:03:14.11,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,两辆车在和一辆RX-7飙车
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.87,2:03:27.75,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,赛车朝中央涩谷方向行驶
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.71,2:03:32.23,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,RX-7到达路口
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.60,2:04:24.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多米尼克·托雷托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dominic Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.02,2:04:26.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不认识我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know me,
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.23,2:04:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你马上会认识了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're about to.
